      "content": "For Senator Miller, emphasize that strengthening Section 4 will position his state as a leader in the emerging green economy. Frame this not as a subsidy grab, but as a strategic investment that creates high-paying, future-proof jobs for his constituents. You can argue that its inclusion signals forward-thinking leadership to national industry leaders and voters. This frames his support as proactive governance, not concession.",
